Package: sppca
Type: Package
Title: Scaled Polyspherical Principal Component Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michael", "Nisenzon", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mnisenzon@unc.edu"),
    person("Eduardo", "García-Portugués", role = "aut"),
    person("J. S.", "Marron", role = "aut"))
Description: Dimension reduction for data on products of spheres
    (polyspheres), such as the spoke directions of skeletal representations
    (s-reps). Implements landmark scaled spherical multidimensional scaling
    to a hypersphere with data-driven radius, principal nested spheres on
    the scaled data, and Nadaraya-Watson / local linear inversion of modes
    of variation back to the polysphere. Competing methods (tangent PCA,
    extrinsic PCA, composite principal nested spheres) are included.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: shapes, polykde, rotasym, stats, graphics, grDevices, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
